    {
        "content": "<p>fitzgen <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14260#issuecomment-5622350218\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14260\">issue #14260</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ideas:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Try to fuse loops in our init function generation optimistically, kind of like run length encoding</li>\n<li>split functions if they are too big</li>\n<li>use winch?</li>\n<li>optimize away null/zero segments, since tables/data is initially null/zero anyways</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
